cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TRACE-AI in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "TRACE-AI: Trustworthy Research Analysis and Citation Engine"
abstract: >-
  TRACE-AI is an evidence-gated research-integrity platform. It analyses
  documents against themes and returns only findings traceable to verified
  source text, with honest, explainable confidence labels and a stage-by-stage
  audit trail. Verification is fully deterministic; in HYBRID mode a language
  model may only synthesise theme names and never decides evidence, scores, or
  status. Guiding principle: No Evidence = No Claim.
type: software
